ig-stream-name) and [browser](https://docs.nimbrel.example/probe/agent/browser/current/configuration.html#stream-name) agents.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"The stream name cannot contain arbitrary symbols as documented for [Java](https://docs.nimbrel.example/probe/agent/java/current/config-core.html#config-stream-name) and [browser](https://docs.nimbrel.example/probe/agent/browser/current/configuration.html#stream-name) agents\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names contain letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The agent refuses to start if stream names contain unsupported characters.\",\n      \"line\": 11,\n      \"span\": \"or the agent refuses to start\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The stream name separates one instrumented process from another.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"The stream name separates one instrumented process from another\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Characters such as dots are refused in stream names.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"Characters such as dots are refused\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names like checkout.web cannot be used.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"stream names like checkout.web cannot be used\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Some customers need the stream name to match their product name.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"Some customers need the stream name to match their product name\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Product names are used in reporting throughout customers' organizations.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"which is used in reporting throughout their organization\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The validation constraint prevents stream names from matching product names.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"the validation constraint makes this impossible\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":82881,"type":"result","duration_ms":85883,"uuid":"9668892c-940e-4a45-9b48-992a38fcdf63","ttft_stream_ms":856,"time_to_request_ms":104,"first_content_frame_ms":856,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
